Package: nxd-common
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Manuel Jesús Romero Mateos <manu4.2012@gmail.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: bash, curl, jq, ca-certificates, apt, dpkg (>= 1.17), coreutils, pkexec, polkitd, console-setup, locales, pulseaudio-utils, e2fsprogs, util-linux, python3, python3-evdev, kmod, sudo, passwd
Homepage: https://github.com/manu-romero-411/nx-debian
Description: Debian on the Nintendo Switch: files of every image
 The system files of the nx-debian images that no Debian or L4T package
 ships: the lightdm seat settings for the Switch's display, the firmware
 names its Wi-Fi/Bluetooth chip asks for, the performance backend (a polkit
 policy so that the user at the console can change the nvpmodel profile, the
 fan mode and the charge limit through pkexec, and the service that applies
 the saved ones at boot), the common locales of Europe, generated, and
 nxd-update, which updates the system, these packages and the Retrobox
 packages from their GitHub releases.
